// HOL Light: Library/permutations.ml:345 / PERMUTES_INSERT
// Source hash: md5:c5495fae2a7c86a0bd9fe12e96eba4f6
// Status: generalization_required (bridges: empty_case:A, hol_prod_setprod)
Theorem PERMUTES_INSERT : forall A:set, forall a :e A, forall s c= A, {p :e A :^: A | permutes A (fun x:set => p x) (SetAdjoin s a)} = {(fun x0 :e A => swap A (a,x 0) (x 1 x0)) | x :e \/_ b :e A, {(b,p) | p :e A :^: A, b :e SetAdjoin s a /\ p :e {p0 :e A :^: A | permutes A (fun x:set => p0 x) s}}}.
Admitted.

